  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with multiprofile settings, scvi_n200 RNA encoder, and weighted fusion (like config_031) achieve high accuracy. This experiment tests whether replacing the image encoder from resnet50 to imagenet_vit_l (while keeping aggregation and fusion methods the same) improves performance, isolating the impact of the image encoder choice. This addresses uncertainty about whether advanced image encoders (like imagenet_vit_l) could further enhance performance in this high-performing setup."
